<Layout title="Sources & Methods"><section class="about-publication"><span class="account-symbol"><Icon name="methods" size={24}/></span><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT EM WEEKLY</p><h1>Collected and reviewed with AI.</h1><p>EM Weekly uses AI to collect, review, and summarize emergency medicine research and clinical guidance. Each article links to its primary source and identifies the material reviewed.</p><p>Content is primarily AI-generated, with limited human editing. Human review is labeled separately on each article. Read the original source before applying findings to patient care.</p></section></Layout>
